The MIT licence covers the code only. Vessel data in data/fixtures and data/eval
comes from Global Fishing Watch (CC BY-NC 4.0). Routes in data/cables are derived
from OpenStreetMap (ODbL 1.0). The UK sanctions snapshot comes from FCDO (OGL v3.0)
via OpenSanctions (CC BY-NC 4.0). Land outlines in docs/img come from Natural Earth
(public domain). See docs/data.md and data/README.md for sources and attribution.
